# Arquitetura To-Be (Estado Ideal)

> **Objetivo:** Representar a arquitetura desejada (target state) com GitOps, observabilidade, segurança e resiliência em produção.

```mermaid
flowchart TB
    subgraph "🔵 DESENVOLVEDOR / CI"
        DEV["💻 Desenvolvedor"]
        PR["🔀 Pull Request"]
        MAIN["🏷️ main branch"]
        CI["⚡ GitHub Actions\nBuild + Test + Scan"]
        IMG["📦 Imagem OCI\n(ghcr.io/...)"]
    end

    subgraph "🌐 GITOPS FLOW (Flux CD)"
        REPO_Helm["📁 Repo: Helm Chart\n(k8s/helm/)"]
        REPO_App["📁 Repo: todolist-app\n(app source)"]
        FLUX["⚙️ Flux CD\n(GitRepository + Kustomization)"]
        IMG_POL["📷 Image Automation\n(ImageRepository + ImagePolicy)"]
        HELM_REL["🎯 HelmRelease\n(todolist-app)"]
    end

    subgraph "☸️ KIND CLUSTER (Kubernetes)"
        subgraph "📦 Infrastructure Layer"
            NGINX["🌐 NGINX Ingress Controller\n(NodePort 80→8080)"]
            METRICS["📊 Metrics Server\n(HPA data)"]
            CERT_MAN["🔒 cert-manager\n(TLS via Let's Encrypt)"]
        end

        subgraph "📐 todolist namespace"
            subgraph "App Tier"
                subgraph "todolist-app (3 pods, HPA 2-10)"
                    POD1["� Pod-1\nFlask + Gunicorn"]
                    POD2["� Pod-2\nFlask + Gunicorn"]
                    POD3["� Pod-N\nFlask + Gunicorn"]
                end
                SVC["🎯 Service ClusterIP"]
                INGRESS["📡 Ingress\n(todolist.local)"]
                HPA["📈 HPA\n(CPU 70%, Mem 80%)"]
                PDB["🛡️ PodDisruptionBudget\n(min 1 pod)"]
                SA["🔑 ServiceAccount\n(Role: list pods, patch cronjob)"]
            end
            subgraph "Data Tier"
                PG["🐘 PostgreSQL 15\n(StatefulSet, 1 replica)"]
                PG_PVC["💾 PersistentVolumeClaim\n(8Gi, HostPath/local)"]
            end
            subgraph "Automation"
                CRON["⏰ CronJob\n(every 5 min)\ncleanup completed todos"]
                RBAC["🔐 Role + RoleBinding\n(list pods, get cronjobs)"]
            end
            subgraph "Configuration"
                CM["📋 ConfigMap\n(APP_NAME, APP_COLOR...)"]
                SEC["🤫 Secret\n(DB credentials, session key)"]
            end
        end
    end

    subgraph "📡 External Access"
        USER["👤 Usuário\n(navegador)"]
        HOST["🖥️ Host\nlocalhost:8080"]
    end

    subgraph "🔍 Observability"
        PROM["📈 Prometheus\n(metrics)"]
        GRAF["📊 Grafana\n(dashboards)"]
        ALERTS["🚨 Alertmanager\n( Slack / PagerDuty )"]
        LOKI["📝 Loki\n(logs)"]
    end

    subgraph "🔐 Security"
        VAULT["🗄️ HashiCorp Vault\n(secrets dinâmicos)"]
        TRIVY["🔎 Trivy\n(vulnerability scan)"]
    end

    %% Developer → CI
    DEV --> PR --> MAIN
    MAIN --> CI
    CI --> IMG

    %% CI → Flux
    IMG --> IMG_POL
    REPO_Helm --> FLUX

    %% Flux → Cluster
    FLUX --> HELM_REL
    IMG_POL -->|image updated| HELM_REL

    %% HelmRelease → Components
    HELM_REL --> NGINX
    HELM_REL -->|todolist namespace| POD1
    HELM_REL --> POD2
    HELM_REL --> POD3
    HELM_REL --> PG
    HELM_REL --> CRON
    HELM_REL --> CM
    HELM_REL --> SEC
    HELM_REL --> SA
    HELM_REL --> RBAC

    %% App connections
    POD1 & POD2 & POD3 --> SVC
    POD1 & POD2 & POD3 --> PG
    POD1 & POD2 & POD3 --> SEC
    SVC --> INGRESS
    INGRESS --> NGINX
    HPA -.->|scale| POD1
    HPA -.->|scale| POD2
    HPA -.->|scale| POD3
    METRICS -.->|metrics| HPA
    CRON --> SEC

    %% External access
    USER -->|http| HOST --> NGINX

    %% Observability
    POD1 & POD2 & POD3 --> PROM
    POD1 & POD2 & POD3 --> LOKI
    PROM --> GRAF
    PROM --> ALERTS

    %% Security
    TRIVY -.->|scan| IMG
    VAULT -.->|inject secrets| SEC

    %% PostgreSQL
    PG --> PG_PVC
```

## Legenda

| Símbolo | Significado |
|---|---|
| `--> ` | Dependência / comunicação direta |
| `-.-> ` | Observação / metrics |
| `subgraph` | Agrupamento lógico (namespace, camada) |

## Fluxo de Deploy (GitOps)

```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
    participant DEV as Desenvolvedor
    participant GH as GitHub
    participant CI as GitHub Actions
    participant REG as GHCR Registry
    participant FLUX as Flux CD
    participant K8S as Kind Cluster

    DEV->>GH: git push (app change)
    GH->>CI: webhook (push to main)
    CI->>CI: Build Dockerfile
    CI->>CI: Trivy scan
    CI->>REG: docker push (ghcr.io/...)
    CI->>GH: commit image tag
    Note over FLUX: Flux detecta nova imagem
    FLUX->>K8S: helm upgrade --install
    K8S->>K8S: RollingUpdate (zero downtime)
    K8S->>FLUX: rollout complete
    Note over FLUX: Sincronizado!
```

